  title: 'The Village That Refused to Give Up',
  grade: 'Class 6',
  emoji: '💧',
  chapterText:
      'The village of Ratanpur, nestled in the parched plains of Kutch, had endured three consecutive '
      'years without adequate rainfall. The wells had run dry, the fields lay barren, and many families had '
      'already migrated to nearby cities in search of work. Twelve-year-old Meera watched her grandfather '
